  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Smart Components is a package of AI-powered components that augment standard Syncfusion controls with intelligent capabilities. It includes Smart Paste (auto-fills forms using clipboard data), Smart TextArea (provides contextual AI writing suggestions), Smart ComboBox (auto-completes selections using AI-driven text matching), and Smart Grid (enables AI-driven filtering and data interactions). These components integrate with AI services to deliver productivity-enhancing, context-aware user experiences in modern ASP.NET Core applications.",
